  "details": "I have an asset that needs to get the avatars bone data when players change into it. There was a issue when FBT Lock-Both was changed to squish the spine bone. This meant that checking the distance between bones wasnt consistent anymore. The ONLY saving grace was that OnAvatarChanged() is called BEFORE the FBT IK is applied. This works, however this is somewhat hidden behaviour and im worried that it is going to be broken in the future. Can we get a way to access the avatar prefabs bone structure instead?",
